This license covers the original TypeScript source in `src/` and its
generated build output. It does not cover the vendored reference material
under `sdk/` (Epson's own ePOS SDK JavaScript source and official
documentation, © Seiko Epson Corporation — not distributed with the
published package; see README). `src/crypto/` is a TypeScript port of the
Diffie-Hellman/Blowfish/MD5 routines bundled in Epson's SDK for its optional
WebSocket-transport encryption; see README for the current status of that
transport before relying on this package's licensing for those files
specifically.
